cked that new `CL_99xxxxx` identifiers chosen for these terms were not already declared as class IRIs.\n- Tried to fetch full text with `aurelian fulltext`, but `aurelian` is not installed in this environment.\n- Looked up the supplied PMIDs via web search/PubMed-linked sources where available and used the issue-provided references conservatively.\n- Ran lightweight local checks confirming each new term has one declaration, one label, and one direct subclass axiom to CL:1001607.\n- Ran `git diff --check -- src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n\n## Validation\n\n`robot` is not installed in this environment, so I could not run ROBOT conversion or reasoning validation.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
